echo, status, log, chore: portable frontmatter across the roster

Every owned skill now carries both a 'Use when' trigger clause and a
'Do not use ... (use <sibling>)' clause, so it fires in Claude Code and
does not over-fire in Codex or Pi. Bodies are byte-identical.
Harvest name matches its directory; new-project frontmatter was invalid
YAML and now parses.

