echo, feat: portable skill frontmatter contract + checker

skill-portability-check.py enforces name == directory and a description
carrying both a 'Use when' and a 'Do not use' clause. Roster went from
33 failing to 0. Live trigger test in Claude Code and Codex recorded in
docs/audits/2026-09-12-portability.md, including the skillOverrides
parity gap it exposed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
