echo, feat: aios-audit compound skill + rot.md decay tiers

Project-level aios-audit owns the harness layer (skills, agents, hooks, rules,
agent memory, cross-harness parity) and delegates the other five audits
read-only. aios-metrics.py prints the machine-readable invariants; it honours
the portability checker's exit code (Gate B r2 K2-03). Also records Gate B
round 2 in the execution log.

